                    <div class="p-3.5 bg-slate-50 rounded-xl border border-slate-200"><strong class="text-edu-700 block text-xs font-bold mb-1">3. Cetak-Audio</strong><p class="text-xs text-slate-600">Buku Bergambar + Pita Audio</p></div>
                    <div class="p-3.5 bg-slate-50 rounded-xl border border-slate-200"><strong class="text-edu-700 block text-xs font-bold mb-1">4. Visual Diam</strong><p class="text-xs text-slate-600">OHP, Slide Transparansi</p></div>
                    <div class="p-3.5 bg-slate-50 rounded-xl border border-slate-200"><strong class="text-edu-700 block text-xs font-bold mb-1">5. Visual Diam Audio</strong><p class="text-xs text-slate-600">Slide Sync + Suara</p></div>
                    <div class="p-3.5 bg-slate-50 rounded-xl border border-slate-200"><strong class="text-edu-700 block text-xs font-bold mb-1">6. Visual Gerak</strong><p class="text-xs text-slate-600">Film Bisu, Animasi tanpa suara</p></div>
                    <div class="p-3.5 bg-slate-50 rounded-xl border border-slate-200"><strong class="text-edu-700 block text-xs font-bold mb-1">7. Visual Gerak Audio</strong><p class="text-xs text-slate-600">Video Pembelajaran, DVD</p></div>
                    <div class="p-3.5 bg-slate-50 rounded-xl border border-slate-200"><strong class="text-edu-700 block text-xs font-bold mb-1">8. Objek Fisik/Realia</strong><p class="text-xs text-slate-600">Model 3D, Mock-up, Maket</p></div>
