                    <div class="p-3.5 bg-slate-50 rounded-xl border border-slate-200"><strong class="text-edu-700 block text-xs font-bold mb-1">10. Komputer</strong><p class="text-xs text-slate-600">CAI, Software Simulasi</p></div>
